  "content": "<p><em>作者更新：</em></p><p>我目前狀況良好，但由於優先事項已改變，無法保證提供更多更新。非常感謝各位給予的正面回饋，畢竟我一開始只是為自己製作模組，上傳時也只是想說或許有人會有興趣。但誰知道未來會如何呢。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenhanced-mob-spawners\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Prospector/badges/master/modrinth-badge-72h-padded.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"72\"></a></p><p><em>增添絲綢之觸採集生怪磚並從中取出生怪蛋的功能，同時提供自訂設定。</em></p><p>+ 可使用絲綢之觸採集生怪磚</p><p>+ 對著生怪磚按右鍵，即可掉落與其內部實體類型對應的生怪蛋。</p><p>+ 所有實體有 4% 機率掉落其生怪蛋 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>（可在設定檔中調整）</em></span></p><p>+ 在創造模式物品欄（裝飾分頁）新增生怪磚方塊</p><p>+ <strong>修改生怪磚的統計數據，例如生成數量、速度和範圍。範例：讓生怪磚在最多 128 格方塊內啟動！原版只有 16 格</strong></p><p>+ 在模組設定檔中自訂所需內容</p><p>+ 透過遊戲內設定選單或紅石切換生怪磚的開啟/關閉</p><p>+ 選擇啟用<strong>有限生成，透過設定檔進行設定！</strong>控制生怪磚在耗盡前能生成的實體數量。<strong>（不支援 Forge 1.18 版本）</strong></p><p>+ 更改所有生怪磚的預設範圍（透過設定檔）</p><p>+ 更改生怪磚方塊的硬度（透過設定檔）</p><h4><strong>Fabric 和 Forge 設定檔：<br></strong></h4><p>設定檔位於 <span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\">.minecraft/config/spawnermod.json<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\">true</span>/<span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\">false</span> 值以 <span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\">1 = true</span> 和 <span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\">0 = false</span> 表示</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">掉落率介於 0 到 100（整數）</span></span></span></p><p>若您使用的是<em><strong>舊版本</strong> </em>模組：設定檔為 <span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\">spawnermod.toml</span> 檔案。</p><p>本模組的目標是為原版 Minecraft 生怪磚增加更多功能。讓玩家能夠移動生怪磚，並透過取出生怪蛋來完全控制其內部的實體類型。</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ArRC2gm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pfTpGCe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/behOrWb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HUbhHmC.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Id78jWY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xCQ9NrB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"596\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oNgS9Mf.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></p><p>歡迎在任何模組包中使用，但請給予標註感謝 :)</p><h4><strong><em>歡迎查看我的其他模組：</em></strong></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/well-fed\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Well Fed - 製作更強效的食物：透過將不同食物組合成一個大餐，減少進食頻率</a></p><p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/sulfur-and-potassium-make-more-gunpowder\" rel=\"nofollow\"> - Sulfur and Potassium - 一種友善原版風格的火藥合成方式</a></p><p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/lamp-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Lamp Block - 一個永遠亮著的紅石燈。讓你能製作無需難看拉桿的燈具</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f321663%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253danders%2540minaemail.se%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f321663%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dEnhanced%2bMob%2bSpawners%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LOz2nLA.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f318696%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253danders%2540minaemail.se%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f318696%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dWell%2bFed%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\">咖啡小費罐</a> - 支持我和我的模組的最佳方式。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝您遊玩我的模組以及請喝咖啡！</p>",
